*'''[[Kidnapping of Gabriella Rosetti]]''': [[File:RosettiInMirror.png|thumb|250px|[[Gabriella Rosetti]] wakes up]] [[Gabriella Rosetti]] wakes up in a room next to "[[Kthara|Daimon Helstrom]]." "Helstrom" asks what happened and where they are, and Rosetti realizes that there is no door. Rosetti finds that there is no way out, when a meal tray is slid through the fireplace. Rosetti starts demanding to be let out, and "Helstrom" asks to figure it out. Rosetti asks if the Blood are responsible, but realizes that they were possessed.{{Ref|HelstromMainPlacement}}{{Ref|HS109}}
