====29th====
*In [[Saint Teresa Center for Mental Health]], [[Louise Hastings]] wakes up in a hospital bed next to [[Caretaker]], who asks how she is feeling. Hastings says that she is hungry and asks to get a taco, impressing Caretaker. Caretaker tells her that they fixed her liver, took out a kidney, and cut out her cancerous lung tumor. Hastings asks about her friends, and Caretaker says taht they are alive, but not well.{{Ref|HelstromMainPlacement}}{{Ref|HS110}}
*[[Chris Yen]] looks over baby [[Kthara]] and is joined by [[Ana Helstrom]]. Yen tells Helstrom that nothing weird has happened and says that it is now his responsibility as a [[Keeper Demons|Keeper Demon]] to prevent her from harming others and herself. He asks for help and her [[Marduk Kurios|father]]'s [[Shard|knife]].{{Ref|HelstromMainPlacement}}{{Ref|HS110}}
*[[Daimon Helstrom]] sits with [[Gabriella Rosetti]] in her hospital room and tells her that the baby is normal, suggesting they raise her in a nurturing environment. Rosetti says she needs to die, calling her a monster who will grow up to kill people. She says that she is being punished for questioning her faith, insisting that she will bear her cross alone. She says that she cannot trust Helstrom or his [[Demons|kind]], upsetting Helstrom. She says that demons' existence is wrong, saying that Helstrom's belief otherwise is either ignorance or evil and that she regrets working at Saint Teresa's.{{Ref|HelstromMainPlacement}}{{Ref|HS110}}
*[[File:H110 Ana marking Chris.png|thumb|250px|[[Chris Yen]] is marked by [[Ana Helstrom]]]] Ana Helstrom performs a ritual to help Yen, using her knife.{{Ref|HelstromMainPlacement}}{{Ref|HS110}}
*Daimon Helstrom stands on {{WPS|St. Johns Bridge}} and looks down, remembering his suicide attempt from the same bridge.{{Ref|HelstromMainPlacement}}{{Ref|HS110}}
*Having gone to ground level, Helstrom is approached by Ana Helstrom, who says she felt like going for a walk. Daimon insists that he is fine, but confesses he is lying. He thanks Ana for saving him, and Ana thanks him for not giving up on her. Daimon comments that he owed her that, but Ana insists that he owes her nothing since they are family. They say they love each other.{{Ref|HelstromMainPlacement}}{{Ref|HS110}}

====30th====
